# Product Cards

## Components

| Component | Path | Usage |
|-----------|------|-------|
| **ProductCard** (normal) | `apps/frontend/src/components/Product/Card.tsx` | Desktop PLP, homepage carousels, PDP related |
| **ProductSmallCard** (small) | `apps/frontend/src/components/Product/SmallCard.tsx` | Mobile PLP, sidebar, favorites, featured category |
| **BlogProductCard** | `apps/frontend/src/components/Blog/BlogProductCard.tsx` | Blog post product carousel |
| **ShoppingCartMobileProductCard** | `apps/frontend/src/components/ShoppingCart/Table/MobileProductCard.tsx` | Cart mobile line items (`lg:hidden`) |

Shared subcomponents live in `apps/frontend/src/components/Product/CardParts/`. Color preview uses `ColorSwatches.tsx`.

## Light-touch policy

- **Preserve layout and composition** — same component trees, overlay positions, hover slide-up (`VariationOverlay`), responsive aspects, and interactions.
- **Visual-only changes** — border radius, neutral palette, typography, price-pill styling, badge appearance.
- **No carousel indicator bars** on PLP/home cards — cover image only in `ImageSlider`.
- Keep global `.interactive-card:hover { translateY(-2px) }` on discovery cards.

## Visual tokens

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Card shell | `rounded-2xl`, `border-slate-100`, `bg-white`, `p-1`, `gap-1` |
| Image radius | `rounded-xl` (12px) |
| Category | `text-xs text-neutral-400` |
| Title | `text-base text-neutral-800`, `line-clamp-1` (or `line-clamp-2` on blog) |
| Price pill | `bg-stone-100`, `rounded-[14px]`, `px-3 py-2`, min-height ~43px on normal card |
| Price hover (desktop) | `bg-infinity-primary`, white / `infinity-primary-lighter` text via `group-hover` + `group-focus-within` |
| Sale badge | `DiscountBadge` — only when `discountPrice > 0 && discountPrice < price`; percent via `computeSaleDiscountPercent` in `utils/discounts.ts` |
| Quick actions chip | `.product-card-glass-chip` — `24×24px`, `padding: 2px`, `bg rgba(0,0,0,0.14)`, `blur(3.65px)`, `border-radius: 8px`, white icons |
| Color badge | `.product-card-color-badge` — `padding: 4px 8px 4px 6px`, same glass bg/blur, `border-radius: 6px`; swatch gradient glow preserved |

## Color badge — always visible

`ColorSwatches` **always renders** on normal, small, and blog product cards:

- Up to **2 swatches** + `+N` remaining when `colorsCount` or `colorCodes` exist.
- **Fallback gradient swatches** when no color data (badge never empty).
- **Not hidden on hover** (no `group-hover:opacity-0` on the badge).

## Sale detection

```typescript
import { computeSaleDiscountPercent } from "@/utils/discounts";

const percent = computeSaleDiscountPercent(price, discountPrice, discount);
// Badge renders only when percent is defined (> 0 and valid sale)
```

## Responsive behavior

- **PLP:** `md+` → `ProductCard`; below `md` → `ProductSmallCard` (see `plp-layout.mdc`).
- **ProductCard image:** `aspect-[3/4]` mobile, `aspect-[250/270]` from `md+`; `w-full min-w-0` in grid cells.
- **ProductSmallCard:** horizontal layout, `h-[116px]`, image `w-24 h-[100px]`.
- Cards scale inside [`StorefrontGrid`](apps/frontend/src/components/storefront/StorefrontGrid.tsx) — do not force fixed `260px` width.

## Cart mobile card

`ShoppingCartMobileProductCard` keeps the **5-row label/value grid** (name, category, price, quantity, line total). Visual tokens align with product cards; quantity control and cart logic unchanged.

